            currentStatus == 0xFFFFFFFFu ? 0u : currentStatus, saneObject ? "yes" : "unknown",
            "yes");

        // V50 never hooks or overrides the status getter. If the caller exposes
        // a stable object/global, watch that field read-only. Otherwise keep the
