            "[FRONTEND-BACKTRACE144] PROVEN authBNet->postFence wrapper=0x%llX inner=0x%llX observedRequiredField=postFence+0x10==1\r\n"
            "[FRONTEND-BACKTRACE144] CURRENT firstState=%s%u dwPathExpectedFinal=dwGetLogOnStatus==2 postFence10=%s0x%08X\r\n",
